HYP-3110 / S263 De Moivre-Jacobi-crystallographic frontier scout
==============================================================================

Status: LRC14 is NOT proved here.
Purpose: identify which new sidecars can be proof-carrier interfaces.

[1] De Moivre quintic fold
  x = u - a/u
  lhs = x^5 + 5*a*x^3 + 5*a^2*x = u^5 - u^-5*a^5
  rhs = u^5 - u^-5*a^5
  difference = 0
  identity_verified = True
  raw Laurent terms before cancellation = 12
  consequence: x^5+5a*x^3+5a^2*x+b=0 reduces to y^2+b*y-a^5=0 with y=u^5.
  LRC use: a degree-5 interaction can collapse only with this retained normal-form sidecar.

